# scripts/versions.env — pinned toolchain versions for Vyomanaut V2.
#
# Single source of truth: docs/runbooks/*.md reference these values by
# name rather than repeating them, so a version bump happens in exactly
# one place. Shell-sourceable (`source scripts/versions.env` or
# `. scripts/versions.env`) for anyone scripting a setup step against
# these pins; PowerShell can read the same file with a one-line parse
# (see docs/runbooks/windows.md).
#
# Where each pin comes from — verify against the real source before
# trusting this file, since a stale copy here is worse than no copy:
#   GO_VERSION          go.mod's own `go` directive
#   ROCKSDB_VERSION      internal/storage/doc.go's "Versions:" block,
#                        and deployments/docker/Dockerfile.ci's
#                        ARG ROCKSDB_VERSION
#   GROCKSDB_VERSION     go.mod's github.com/linxGnu/grocksdb require line
#   GOLANGCI_LINT_VERSION .github/workflows/ci.yml's golangci-lint-action
#                        `version:` field
#
# [REF: build_M17E.md Phase 17.8; cross-platform hardening pass following
# Session 17.8.1]

GO_VERSION=1.26.2
ROCKSDB_VERSION=10.10.1
GROCKSDB_VERSION=v1.10.8
GOLANGCI_LINT_VERSION=v2.12.2

# Windows needs NEITHER ROCKSDB_VERSION nor GROCKSDB_VERSION — see
# internal/storage/engine_badger.go (`//go:build windows`) and
# engine_rocksdb.go (`//go:build linux || darwin`). Only Mac and Linux
# build/link against RocksDB at all.
